PackageVersion: @VERSION@
PackageLocale: en-US
Publisher: "PlentyLabs UG (haftungsbeschränkt) & Co. KG"
PublisherUrl: https://chatwithwork.com
PublisherSupportUrl: https://github.com/crmne/chatwithwork-local-agent/issues
PrivacyUrl: https://chatwithwork.com/privacy
Author: Carmine Paolino
PackageName: Chat with Work Local Agent
PackageUrl: https://github.com/crmne/chatwithwork-local-agent
License: MIT OR Apache-2.0
LicenseUrl: https://github.com/crmne/chatwithwork-local-agent#license
Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Carmine Paolino
ShortDescription: Chat with Work desktop app, terminal interface and local background agent.
Description: |-
  The Chat with Work Local Agent (cww) lets the Chat with Work assistant search and read the folders you
  choose on this computer, and nothing else. Includes the desktop app, terminal interface and daemon.
  The installer starts the agent at login. If startup fails, open Chat with Work or run cww daemon install.
  Folders are read-only unless you allow changes. It connects over one outbound WebSocket,
  keeps its full-text index on your machine, and never shares secrets such as keys, .env files or password
  databases, even inside a shared folder. Every request is written to a local audit log.
Moniker: cww
